    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "7565401",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "756540201",
                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                    "text": "The Fortune Slip I received at the Grand Narukami Shrine stated that Great Fortune shall be with me and that I should expect a reunion."
                },
                {
                    "id": "756540202",
                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                    "text": "#It seems the reunion was to be with you. It's been a while, {NICKNAME}.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "756540203",
                            "text": "We're here to take pictures of Inazuma City.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "756540205",
                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                    "text": "Ah, an elegant pursuit. To take pictures of scenery one has witnessed is to remind oneself of one's journey thus far."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756540206",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "What about you, Kazuha?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756540207",
                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                    "text": "I have presently made plans to meet Mr. Nakanishi at the teahouse to discuss the art of the tea ceremony. He is well-versed in the relevant disciplines, and is a regular there."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756540208",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "Are you an expert too?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756540209",
                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                    "text": "I studied for a time in my youth, but my knowledge then was quite shallow. I have found it all the more fascinating while revisiting it for study as of late."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756540210",
                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                    "text": "For example, the nations differ in their manifestations of said ceremonies. For Inazuma, we emphasize the spirit of \"purity\" and \"tranquility.\""
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756540211",
                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                    "text": "Liyue's Qiaoying Village also produces tea, and the people of that land lean towards \"harmony\" and \"authenticity.\""
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "756540212",
                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                    "text": "These differences also reflect the two people's differences in living habits. Most fascinating.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "756540213",
                                            "text": "You're a real lover of learning.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756540215",
                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                    "text": "Haha, hardly... In truth, I did not return here solely for that."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756540216",
                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                    "text": "This is the land of my birth, and so it remains, though I was once compelled to leave."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756540217",
                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                    "text": "Returning every once in a while, seeing people I knew in my youth, spending time in familiar places..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756540218",
                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                    "text": "I feel as if I still have roots here, which relieves the cares of my wanderings."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756540219",
                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                    "text": "To use Kameras to immortalize such memories is a wonderful idea. We wanderers need our anchors more than anyone, after all."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756540220",
                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                    "text": "Anyway, that's quite enough about me. I don't wish to take up your time, but if you need any aid, simply say the word."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756540221",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "Alright. Step into the frame, then, if you would!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "756540222",
                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                    "text": "Easily done. What sort of pose would be best for the shot?",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "756540223",
                                                            "text": "One that's more casual.",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "756540226",
                                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                                    "text": "Of course. How does this look?",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "756540227",
                                                                            "text": "Perfect. Say cheese!"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "756540228",
                                                                            "text": "Let's go with our relaxed pose instead.",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "756540229",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                                                    "text": "Let us do so."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "756540230",
                                                                            "text": "I think deep thought works better.",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "756540231",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                                                    "text": "Of course."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "756540232",
                                                                            "text": "Let's roll with the casual pose instead.",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "756540233",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                                                                                    "text": "Fair enough."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "756540224",
                                                            "text": "A relaxed pose."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "756540225",
                                                            "text": "Perhaps one displaying deep thought."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "756540214",
                                            "text": "A man of elegant tastes, I see."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "756540204",
                            "text": "We're looking for people to take photos with."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7565403",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "756540310",
                    "speaker": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
                    "text": "I'm ready."
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
